        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#898989' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10' italic='true'>La Jolla commands the largest premium at +90% above the city median, followed by Mission Bay (+65%). About 75% of neighborhoods trade at a discount (orange), indicating San Diego&apos;s median is pulled up by a small set of coastal premium markets.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
