                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>→ Established destinations — High price + high sentiment </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>Lower-RIGHT </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e15759' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>⚠ Caution Zone </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10' italic='true'>High price, mixed reviews </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>→ Buyer beware </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>Bubble size = Supply </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
